{
  "indexVersion": 1,
  "contracts": {
    "projectModel": "docs/contracts/project-model.md (packet 20, §§10.5–10.8, 12, 13.1, 18–22)"
  },
  "notes": [
    "Packet 20 model fixtures. They pin the packet-20 v2 scene/content/captured-content/settings/migration validators. The M1 fixtures under fixtures/project-model/ are unchanged and keep passing byte-identically.",
    "Dispatch: kind scene-v2 -> validateSceneV2/parseSceneV2; content -> validateContent/normalizeContent; project-v2 -> validateProjectV2 (the file is {manifest, scene, content}); migration-scene-v1-to-v2 -> migrateSceneV1ToV2.",
    "Valid entries must round-trip byte-exactly: parse -> normalize -> serializeCanonical -> parse must be byte-identical and idempotent, and the canonical bytes must equal the committed file bytes.",
    "Invalid entries must fail non-destructively: the exact error-code set is pinned; the source bytes must be retained unchanged by the pure validators.",
    "valid/project-v2.json embeds copies of valid/scene-v2.json and valid/content.json; the test asserts they deep-equal, so the composition fixture cannot drift."
  ],
  "entries": [
    {
      "path": "valid/scene-v2.json",
      "kind": "scene-v2",
      "entryPoint": "validateSceneV2",
      "valid": true,
      "expectedNormalized": "valid/scene-v2.json",
      "notes": "SchemaVersion 2 scene exercising every v2 component: camera, group, model+behavior values, box collider, polygon collider, controller, prefab provenance. Canonical (byte-exact) already."
    },
    {
      "path": "valid/content.json",
      "kind": "content",
      "entryPoint": "validateContent",
      "valid": true,
      "expectedNormalized": "valid/content.json",
      "notes": "Content catalog with two asset versions, one prefab definition, one declaration-only behavior (source null) covering number/boolean/string/enum/vec3/entityRef/assetRef, the six settings keys and an empty behaviorTrust."
    },
    {
      "path": "valid/project-v2.json",
      "kind": "project-v2",
      "entryPoint": "validateProjectV2",
      "valid": true,
      "notes": "Three-block composition: manifest v1 + embedded scene v2 + content. Cross-block references all resolve; the embedded scene/content must deep-equal the standalone fixtures."
    },
    {
      "path": "migration/scene-v1-input.json",
      "kind": "migration-scene-v1-to-v2",
      "entryPoint": "migrateSceneV1ToV2",
      "valid": true,
      "expectedNormalized": "migration/scene-v2-expected.json",
      "notes": "M1 schemaVersion 1 scene (4 entities, parented box, uppercase material color). The pure conversion emits the canonical v2 document with the same sceneId, revision and entity IDs; the input bytes are retained unchanged."
    },
